      <Article>
        <ArticleTitle>GPLD1 regulates cardiac function in heart failure</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>GPLD1 (phosphatidylinositol-glycan-specific phospholipase D) plays a critical role in cardiovascular disease. We show that GPLD1 expression is elevated in patients with heart failure and contributes to myocardial remodeling.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
