      <Article>
        <ArticleTitle>Exercise-induced GPLD1 secretion improves vascular health</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>Physical exercise promotes the secretion of GPLD1 from liver, which enhances vascular function through GPI-anchor cleavage. This mechanism may explain the cardiovascular benefits of exercise.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
